---
---
<section class="contact section-pad" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start something</p>
      <h2>Have an idea<br>worth <em>building?</em></h2>
      <p>Tell us what you are working on. Let's find the right direction and the next practical step.</p>
      <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:venweyofficial@gmail.com">venweyofficial@gmail.com <span>↗</span></a>
      <a class="contact-phone" href="tel:+919496011781">+91 9496011781</a>
    </div>
    <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm">
      <label for="name">Your name</label>
      <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Name" required>
      <label for="email">Email address</label>
      <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
      <label for="service">What can we help with?</label>
      <select id="service" name="service">
        <option value="Not sure yet">Choose a capability</option>
        <option value="Brand">Brand</option>
        <option value="Lab">Lab</option>
        <option value="Grow">Grow</option>
        <option value="General enquiry">General enquiry</option>
      </select>
      <label for="message">A little about your project</label>
      <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about your idea..." required></textarea>
      <button class="button button-gold" type="submit">Send enquiry <span>↗</span></button>
      <p class="form-note">Your email app will open with your enquiry ready to send. See our <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p class="form-status" id="formStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
